    "body": "## Summary\n- adds the second Stage 7.15 scripted conflict with Настя after the first battle victory\n- routes the battle through the existing Conflict API and preserves the ordinary crowd-vote flow\n- keeps the orange argument hidden until the result, shows the influence explanation, and opens the next scripted flow on loss\n- adds stage715_nastya_battle_started and stage715_nastya_battle_result telemetry\n\n## Validation\n- JavaScript syntax checks\n- Stage 7.15.21 contract and Stage 7.15 first-battle regression checks\n- relevant Stage 7 contract checks\n- local Chromium smoke: prompt, exact choices, hidden orange argument, payoff/crowd vote, loss flow, and telemetry\n\nKnown baseline failures on current main: test_stage7_6_visible_follow_up_reaction.py, test_stage7_7_preunlock_corridor.py, and test_stage7_12_first_real_battle_aftermath.py.",
